      "score": 584,
      "comments": 214,
      "author": "bluehatbrit",
      "published": "2026-07-31T19:03:45Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Zero-trust network overlays like Tailscale cannot prevent breaches stemming from compromised application API tokens or developer credentials.",
        "Hugging Face secret exposure highlights risks to hosted models; teams must enforce scoped, short-lived API keys for AI services.",
        "Effective AI pipeline security requires defense-in-depth, combining network controls with automated secret scanning, rotation, and strict runtime auditing."
      ]
    },
