      "comments": null,
      "author": "Alexander Neubeck",
      "published": "2026-07-31T16:00:00Z",
      "bullets": [
        "GitHub scaled code search string case-folding to over 45 GiB/s on a single CPU core.",
        "The throughput is achieved using a branch-free loop coupled with low-level byte-space arithmetic.",
        "Avoiding early-exit conditional branches prevents CPU pipeline stalls, allowing text transformations to match memory bandwidth."
      ]
